	(text "L2 10 µH (same part as L1) + C26 / C27: a pi filter\nof its own for the IMU and screen converters, so the screen's\n20 W converter neither loads nor disturbs the logic supply\n(L1, Power sheet). Load at 24 V: IMU ≈ 0.02 A (CV7 0.23 W) +\nscreen ≤ 0.95 A ≈ 1 A (0.79 A peak at start-up, LTspice AUX1);\nL2 is rated 2.1 A (2.9 A saturation).\nBoth converters are isolated modules; on this board their\ninput and output sides share the one GND (as the logic DC/DC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 68.58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "2820e12f-efb5-5723-9561-5487216fa272")
	)
