	(text "Same parts as the MES3.1-Carrier-LH \"IMU Power Supply @ 9V\":\nU9 YLPTEC URB2409S-6WR3 (9-36 V in, 9 V 0.67 A, 6 W isolated, short-circuit protected; the logic DC/DC's\nfamily and footprint. MES3.1 U15 is the 10 W URB2409S-10WR3, which JLC can't assemble), C28 47 µF / 100 V\nand C29 22 µF / 16 V (the MES3.1 Cin / Cout),\nSW2 SS12D10G5 slide switch (MES3.1 U22, common = pin 2), J14 KF250NH 2-pin (MES3.1 CN10).\nCTRL open = on. IMU: MicroStrain 3DM-CV7-AHRS on the C-Series Connectivity Board (6212-3009 kit), ≈ 45 mA at 9 V\n(SW2 0.5 A rating OK). Wire J14 to the board's Vaux (5.2-28 V, micro-DB9 pin 6), NEVER Vpri (3.2-5.2 V, pin 3,\nstraight to the CV7). Vaux or Vpri, not both: switch SW2 off while the USB dev cable (5 V on Vpri) is plugged in.\nLED8 green (+ R35 2.2k, 3.2 mA) sits after SW2: it lights only when the IMU terminal is powered.\nJLC part C7468814."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 68.58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d57bcad9-8868-51ce-8c69-3f1ac9b73d05")
	)
